<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Happy Birthday, Sayang! 🎉</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon">
    <style>
        body {
            text-align: center;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #ffe4e1;
            color: #333;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #ff69b4;
        }
        .heart {
            font-size: 50px;
            color: red;
            animation: pulse 1s infinite alternate;
        }
        @keyframes pulse {
            from { transform: scale(1); }
            to { transform: scale(1.2); }
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: auto;
            background: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0px 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        .btn {
            background: #ff69b4;
            color: white;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        .music, .images {
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        img {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 500px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-top: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0px 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            animation: fadeIn 1.5s ease-in-out;
        }
        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.9); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>🎂 Happy Birthday, Cantik! 🎂</h1>
        <p>Hari ini adalah hari spesial karena kamu lahir ke dunia. Aku bersyukur bisa bertemu dan menjalankan semuanya bersamamu. Semoga Allah selalu memudahkan jalan dan rezekimu. ❤️</p>
        <p class="heart">💖💖💖</p>
        <p>Semoga semua impian dan harapanmu tercapai. Aku akan selalu ada untukmu! 🎁</p>
        <a class="btn" href="https://open.spotify.com/track/4OBZT9EnhYIV17t4pGw7ig?si=33d5b806fd2f402f" target="_blank">Klik untuk Playlist Spesial 🎶</a>
        <div class="music">
            <iframe style="border-radius:12px" src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/track/4OBZT9EnhYIV17t4pGw7ig?utm_source=generator" width="100%" height="352" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" loading="lazy"></iframe>
        </div>
        <div class="images">
            <img src="foto1.jpg" alt="Foto 1">
            <img src="foto2.jpg" alt="Foto 2">
            <img src="foto3.jpg" alt="Foto 3">
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>